	(text "Piezo passes J3 -> J4 to the main board unchanged; R11 1M taps it (no load on the main comparator).  C12/R12 high-pass about 480 Hz, gain 1 + R13/R14 = 101, R13/C13 low-pass about 3.4 kHz, R15/C15 anti-alias."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 308.61 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7a057d51-d2c5-57c9-bc81-3388c9de3e43")
	)
	(text "U4 and its bias run from AMP_PWR only in the night listening window.  D1 clamps the tap to the amplifier rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 308.61 215.65 0)
		(effects
